        <item>The soft input is always visible, as set in the current input layout.</item>
        <item>When a controller is connected, console buttons (A B X Y, D-Pad, L, R, Start, and Select) are hidden. Other buttons in the current input layout remain visible.</item>
        <item>When a controller is connected, all inputs assigned to that controller are hidden. Other inputs present in the current input layout that are not assigned to the connected controllers remain visible.</item>
        <item>The soft input is always invisible, independently of the buttons found in the current input layout.</item>
    </array>
